ZbaKGB4u07jTPDBBqFhPUp_cPU2Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af0RKmd-2buUVup35h5c5JQFggls6qA9fLQzlxBI-7Wa0w&oe=69F1ED97"}, "display_name": "PlayMaker", "keywords": [], "long_description": "PlayMaker is an innovative VR sports app dedicated to soccer, transforming how teams strategize and collaborate. As a multiplayer platform, it allows users to create, visualize, and share tactical plays in a dynamic mixed-reality environment.\n\nKey Features:\n\nInteractive Strategy Creation: Design and manipulate soccer plays in 3D, offering in-depth tactical understanding.\n\nMixed Reality Meetups: Connect with friends or teammates in a virtual setting, ideal for discussing strategies or socializing.\n\nYouTube Integration: Analyze weekend matches in-app, facilitating group discussions and breakdowns of key game moments.\n\nMeta Avatar Customization: Personalize your meta avatar with team jerseys and accessories, enhancing engagement.\n\nReal-Time Collaboration: Work together in real-time, share ideas, and adjust tactics with teammates or coaches, irrespective of physical location.\n\nEnhanced Communication Tools: Utilize integrated voice chat and gesture recognition for natural, effortless team discussions.\n\nPlayMaker is more than just a tactical tool; it's a bridge between virtual and physical sports training, perfect for soccer teams and enthusiasts eager to leverage technology for an edge in their game.", "short_description": "PlayMaker is an innovative VR sports app dedicated to soccer, transforming how teams strategize and collaborate. As a multiplayer platform, it allows users to create, visualize, and share tactical plays in a dynamic mixed-reality environment."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://rezzil.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Rezzil", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://rezzil.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": null, "comfort_tags": [],